 succeeded in 0ms:
an8.39:1.2 | S: What eight? | T: What eight?
an8.39:1.3 | S: Firstly, a noble disciple has gone for refuge to the Buddha. | T: (1) “Here, a noble disciple has gone for refuge to the Buddha.
